{title: Kadhal Oru Aagayam}
{artist: Teejay Al Rufian Hiphop Tamizha}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Kadhal Oru Aag [G]ayam,        Adhu [Am]Endrum Vizhvathu Illaiyaadi
[Em]Kaner Oru Ven [G]megam,        Vizha [Am]mal Irupathum Illaiyaadi
[Em]Kadalukule [G]Meen Azhdhal,        Meen [Am]Kaner Veliye Theriyathe
[Em]Unnai Mela [G]Ni Unarndhal,        Un [Am]Kadhal Endrum Priyathe
[Em]Kadhal Oru Aag [G]ayam,        Adhu [Am]Endrum Vizhvathu Illaiyaadi
[Em]Kanner Oru Venm [G]egamm,        Vizh [Am]amal Irupathum Illaiyadi
[Em]Idhayamm Ketkum [Am]Kadhaluku,        Vera [Em]Yedhaiyum Ketida [Am]Theriyadhu
[Em]Anbae Ketkum [Am]Kadhalooku,        Send [D]hegam Thangida [Am]Mudiyathu
[G]Medu Palam Illamal,        Oru Pathai Ingu [Am]Kidaiyathu
[Em]Pirivum Thuyaram Illamal,        Oru [C]Kadhalin Aazham [Em]Puriyathu
[Em]Kadhal Oru Aag [G]ayamm,        Adhu [Am]Endrum Vizhvathu Illaiyaadi
[Em]Kaner Oru Venm [G]egam,        Vizh [Am]amal Irupathumm Illaiyaadi
[Em]Kadalukule Meen [Am]Azhdhall,        Meen [Em]Kaner Veliye [Am]Theriyathe
[Em]Unnai Mela Nee [Am]Unarndhal,        Un [D]Kadhal Endrum [Am]Priyatheyy
[Em]Kadhal Oru Aag [G]ayamm,        Adhu [Am]Endrum Vizhvathu Illaiyadii
[Em]Kaner Oru Venm [G]egam,        Vizh [Am]amal Irupathum Illaiyadi
Illaiyadi Illaiyadi,        Illaiyadi Illaiyadi
